  Lines:
  - SpeakerName: Beastman Chieftain
    DialogueText: The reinforcements are crushed! Their bodies litter the pass.
    PortraitLeft: {fileID: 0}
    PortraitMiddle: {fileID: 0}
    PortraitRight: {fileID: 0}
    Background: {fileID: 0}
    Focus: 0
    BackgroundOverlay: 0
    EventID: 
    VoiceClip: {fileID: 0}
  - SpeakerName: Mercenary
    DialogueText: They won't recover from a blow like that. Their main outpost is
      completely exposed now.
    PortraitLeft: {fileID: 0}
    PortraitMiddle: {fileID: 0}
    PortraitRight: {fileID: 0}
    Background: {fileID: 0}
    Focus: 0
    BackgroundOverlay: 0
    EventID: 
    VoiceClip: {fileID: 0}
  - SpeakerName: Lilith
    DialogueText: Then let us descend and finish what they started. Leave no stone
      standing.
    PortraitLeft: {fileID: 0}
    PortraitMiddle: {fileID: 0}
    PortraitRight: {fileID: 0}
    Background: {fileID: 0}
    Focus: 0
